Full suite:\n  - `PYTHONPATH=/tmp/csvtool_pytest_vendor python3 -m pytest tests`\n  - Result: `9 passed in 0.25s`\n\nNote:\n- The requested `python -m pytest tests` could not run here because `python` is absent and system `python3` had no installed `pytest`. I verified with local vendored pytest under `PYTHONPATH`, then ran the full suite successfully.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_09371304601b5e29016a960c755cdc87d28d22a7ee5aee3836\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1217,"output":507,"cacheRead":31232,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32956,"reasoningTokens":45,"cost":{"input":0.0030425,"output":0.007605,"cacheRead":0.007808,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0184555}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788218483417,"responseId":"resp_09371304601b5e29016a960c73ba4087d28f897983b542c4a3","duration":10369.101980000007,"ttft":1153.248454000015}}
